1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Car shakes at a stoplight?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The pattern is the clue.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Only shakes at idle, fades once moving?

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
That can point to a spark plug or misfire.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Worse in Drive or Reverse than Park?

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Worth checking the motor mounts.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
A small shake now can turn into

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
a rough-running engine later.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Don't guess.

10
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Nick's Tire & Auto checks it free. Link in bio.
